    "verified": "2026-07-25",
    "notes": "Per-member coverage. The chamber-wide newsroom at /media/newsroom stopped server-rendering its item list (card body ships empty), which silently killed collection after 2026-07-18. Collection is now keyed to each member's own Media pages: CurrentMedia?id=<member_id> is page 1, MediaArchive?id=<member_id> is page 2. Both server-render and expose the same /Media/NewsDetails?id= item links the extractor already targets. District 10 is vacant, so this seed carries 33 of 34 seats. The retired aggregate row 'mo-senate-newsroom' was removed from this seed but is intentionally left in the database with its 34 historical records; those records keep the aggregate official_id because the upsert never reassigns official_id on an existing source_url. expect_empty is set for the four members whose CurrentMedia page is genuinely empty today (Schroer d2, Nurrenbern d17, Webber d19, Hough d30); Nurrenbern and Hough still have MediaArchive items, which a multi-page backfill picks up."
